msgstr "[Geriatrische evaluaties](evaluations.md) — MMSE, Braden, MNA, OHAT, Tinetti en pijn."

#: ../../content/residents/index.md:66
msgid "[Rooms and occupancy](chambres.md) — the board, the room record, generating the rooms."
msgstr "[Kamers en bezetting](chambres.md) — het bord, de kamerfiche, het genereren van de kamers."

#: ../../content/residents/index.md:67
msgid "[Room change and transfer](changement-chambre.md) — now or on a later date."
msgstr "[Kamerwissel en overdracht](changement-chambre.md) — nu of op een latere datum."

#: ../../content/residents/index.md:68
msgid "[Room housekeeping](entretien-chambres.md) — to prepare, to clean, ready."
msgstr "[Onderhoud van de kamers](entretien-chambres.md) — klaar te maken, schoon te maken, klaar."

#: ../../content/residents/index.md:69
msgid "[Staff tasks](taches.md) — the chores of the house, by team."
